<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443840823"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:47.507"><div begin="10.568" end="29.719" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="10.568" end="15.085" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.568" end="10.985">晨</span><span begin="10.985" end="11.324">曦</span><span begin="11.324" end="11.915">细</span><span begin="11.915" end="12.398">雨</span> <span begin="12.649" end="13.587">重临在</span><span begin="13.587" end="14.001">这</span><span begin="14.001" end="14.591">大</span><span begin="14.591" end="15.085">地</span></p><p begin="15.809" end="19.372" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.809" end="17.510">人孤孤单单</span><span begin="17.510" end="18.423">躲</span><span begin="18.423" end="19.372">避</span></p><p begin="21.004" end="26.058" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.004" end="21.707">转身</span><span begin="21.707" end="22.352">刹</span><span begin="22.352" end="22.938">那</span> <span begin="22.995" end="23.903">在这熟</span><span begin="23.903" end="24.343">悉</span><span begin="24.343" end="25.007">的</span><span begin="25.007" end="25.580">路</span><span begin="25.580" end="26.058">旁</span></p><p begin="26.557" end="29.719" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.557" end="28.498">察觉身后路人</span><span begin="28.498" end="28.958">是</span><span begin="28.958" end="29.719">你</span></p></div><div begin="31.414" end="50.892" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="31.414" end="36.003" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.414" end="32.154">如一</span><span begin="32.154" end="32.765">套</span><span begin="32.765" end="33.233">戏</span> <span begin="33.439" end="34.388">重逢在</span><span begin="34.388" end="34.794">这</span><span begin="34.794" end="35.422">旧</span><span begin="35.422" end="36.003">地</span></p><p begin="36.671" end="39.993" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.671" end="38.662">而彼此不知怎</span><span begin="38.662" end="39.355">预</span><span begin="39.355" end="39.993">备</span></p><p begin="41.784" end="46.